msgstr "Meka kozongisa cv2 ."

#: src/onboarding.py:341
msgid "No webcams found on system"
msgstr "Webcams ezwami te na système"

#: src/onboarding.py:341
msgid ""
"Please configure your camera yourself if you are sure a compatible camera is "
"connected"
msgstr ""
"Svp configurer camera na yo yo moko soki ozali sûr que caméra compatible "
"ezali connecté"

#: src/onboarding.py:433
msgid "No, camera can't be opened"
msgstr "Te, camera ekoki kofungwama te"

#: src/onboarding.py:445
msgid "No, not an infrared camera"
msgstr "Te, kamera ya infrarouge te"

#: src/onboarding.py:449
msgid "Yes, compatible infrared camera"
msgstr "Oui, caméra infrarouge compatible"

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid "Camera identifier or path"
msgstr "Identifiant ya kamera to nzela"

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Kolendisa"

#: src/onboarding.py:546 src/onboarding.py:585
msgid "Error selecting camera"
msgstr "Libunga na kopona kamera"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Caméra oyo oponi ekoki kofungwama te"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Meká kopona mosusu"

#: src/onboarding.py:575
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Tosɛngi bino bókende kotala\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"mpo na ko activer émetteur na yo ya ir"

#: src/onboarding.py:643
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Bobongisi ya mwinda 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Bobongisi ya mwinda 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ekoki ko sauver modèle ya elongi te"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan modèle ya mibale"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ekokaki ko enregistrer modèle ya mibale te"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Modèle na yo ya liboso ebombami, yango wana login ya elongi esalaka déjà. "
"Chambre esengeli kaka ezala kongenga mpo na komona elongi na yo — bongola "
"mwinda na esika ya kokanga yango — sima meka lisusu, to sauter mpe bakisa "
"modèle moko sima uta na Paramètres."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Scan ya mibale: éclairage différent"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Modèle ya liboso ebombami. Sikawa bongola mwinda — ndakisa kofungola to "
"kokanga mwinda, mosika na lininisa, to salelá mwinda ya shambre mosusu — "
"kobatela elongi na yo komonana polele, nsima finá lisusu Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Kotala matériel mpe bisaleli ya TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami. Kotia <i>tpm2-tools</i> na "
"ndenge ya automatique..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel TPM 2.0 ezali kosala. Mot de passe na yo "
"ekokangama malamu na kati ya TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami, kasi botiami ya automatique "
"ya <i>tpm2-tools</i> elongi te. Tambwisa <code>sudo apt installation tpm2-"
"tools</code>. Kozonga sima na caching ya ba credentiels basé na logiciel."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka "
"authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ezalela ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami te. Kosalela caching ya ba "
"credentiels oyo esalemi na logiciel (AES-256-GCM)."

