#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kaka modèle moko ya elongi nde ekomisami. Mwinda ebongoli ndenge elongi na "
"yo emonanaka na kamera, yango wana modèle moko ekoki kozanga na mpokwa na "
"nse ya miinda (to na moi). Bakisa modèle ya mibale oyo ekomamaki na lumière "
"différente mpo na ko garder déverrouillage fiable na heure nionso ya mokolo."

#: src/main.ui:144
