#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Beta son ya système mpo na komeka oyo eyebani to oyo elongi te."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Salá mpe ba diagnostics"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Bakisa modèle, certitude vs seuil, cadres, caméra na timing na carte moko na "
"moko. Ezali na ntina ntango ozali koyebisa mokakatano moko."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Clé / KWallet Déverrouillage automatique"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Activer authentification ya elongi mpo na ko débloquer automatiquement clé "
"ya bokɔti na yo to KWallet na bokɔti. Yango ebombaka malamu mot de passe na "
"yo ekangami na TPM soki ezali, to e chiffré na AES-256-GCM na kosalelaka "
"fungola ya masta ya misisa kaka. Face auth etie PAM_AUTHTOK pona "
"pam_gnome_keyring to pam_kwallet5 selon bureau na yo."

